        <!-- THE SELL ORDER LIST IS BY BREED (28.7). A breed is a stable identity a
             player can aim an order at; a cluster is not, and its age and worth
             each describe one slice of a breed rather than the breed. -->
        <!-- WHERE A BREED'S EARNINGS COME FROM, per product. The model prices RAW
             fill types and cannot see what a farm does downstream, so a figure that
             is arithmetically right can still be wrong for this player: manure
             sold is worth a fraction of manure digested. Naming the terms is what
             lets them argue with it. The note line is 1096px over two lines. -->
        <text name="ar_bs_breedTerms"    text="%s：%d 头，每头每月收益 %s -- %s。 一头幼崽价值 %s。"/>
        <text name="ar_bs_breedNoEarn"   text="%s：%d 头。 没有可计价的月度产出，因此此处的栏位收益仅等于动物本身的价值。"/>
